--[[
    KRONOS CHAT — V1 SIMULATION / GUI DEMO
    ----------------------------------------------------------------
    This is a lightweight visual simulation of the current Kronos Chat
    interface. It intentionally does NOT connect to Firebase, remote
    role lists, external APIs, or game-specific remotes.

    Purpose:
      • Recreate the recognizable Kronos Chat V1-style interface
      • Demonstrate the layout, tabs, messages, stickers and popups
      • Keep the implementation simple and safe to modify

    Place as a LocalScript in StarterPlayerScripts or StarterGui.
]]

